<title>SOUTH KOREA: Dae Han seeks 12,500T of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Dae Han seeks 12,500T of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Dae Han Flour Mills Co Ltd has invited tenders for 12,500 tonnes of U.S. wheat by 2.00 p.m. (0500 GMT) on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>They said shipment was set for January 15-February 15 to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
